WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:05.000
Mother put some pies in a basket.

00:05.000 --> 00:10.000
“Take these to Grandma,” she said.

00:10.000 --> 00:15.000
Little Red Riding Hood followed the forest path.

00:15.000 --> 00:20.000
At the edge of the woods, she waved hello.

00:20.000 --> 00:25.000
A wolf met her where the path divided.

00:25.000 --> 00:30.000
“Where are you going?” he asked.

00:30.000 --> 00:35.000
The wolf reached Grandma’s house first.

00:35.000 --> 00:40.000
He hid Grandma and put on her bonnet.

00:40.000 --> 00:45.000
“Grandma, why are your ears so big?”

00:45.000 --> 00:50.000
The girl recognized the wolf and called for help.

00:50.000 --> 00:55.000
A forester heard her and hurried to the house.

00:55.000 --> 01:00.000
The frightened wolf ran back into the woods.

01:00.000 --> 01:05.000
Grandma came out safe and sound.

01:05.000 --> 01:10.000
Little Red Riding Hood gave her a big hug.

01:10.000 --> 01:15.000
They all sat down for tea and pies.

01:15.000 --> 01:20.000
Their worrying day ended with a warm evening.
